{"attack":"发射鳞片进行攻击。连续攻击2~5次。速度会提高但防御会降低。","description":"攻击目标造成伤害，一回合内连续攻击2～5次。命中时，各有15%的几率攻击5或4次，35%的几率攻击3或2次，攻击次数的数学期望是3.1次，对应的威力的数学期望是77.5。\n携带机变骰子且命中时，各有1⁄2的几率攻击5或4次，攻击次数的数学期望是4.5次，对应的威力的数学期望是112.5。\n每一击击中要害的概率都相等。\n如果某一下触发了目标的气势披带、气势头带、结实特性或打破了替身，招式会继续攻击。\n忍耐、金属爆炸和双倍奉还只计算最后一次的伤害。\n如果使用者持有王者之证或锐利之牙，或具有恶臭特性，每一下攻击都有相同的概率造成对手畏缩。\n如果目标拥有咒术之躯、碎裂铠甲特性，每一下攻击都会触发效果。即使特性发动令攻击方陷入一些可能无法行动的状态（如麻痹、畏缩、着迷、定身法状态），也不会影响本次攻击，但陷入睡眠和濒死时攻击即刻停止。\n目标的变色特性在最后一下攻击完成后才发动。\n令使用者的防御降低1级。\n令使用者的速度提升1级。即使使用者具有强行特性，该效果仍会发动，并且鳞射的威力不会提高。","levelUpMoves":[],"tutorMoves":["Charizard","Horsea","Seadra","Goldeen","Seaking","Gyarados","Dratini","Dragonair","Dragonite","Dragonite form:creator","Mew","Dunsparce","Qwilfish","Kingdra","Lugia","Sceptile","Carvanha","Sharpedo","Flygon","Feebas","Milotic","Relicanth","Latias","Latios","Rayquaza","Gible","Gabite","Garchomp","Dialga","Palkia","Basculin form:red","Basculin form:blue","Krookodile","Axew","Fraxure","Haxorus","Druddigon","Hydreigon","Reshiram","Zekrom","Kyurem","Kyurem form:black","Kyurem form:white","Skrelp","Dragalge","Helioptile","Heliolisk","Tyrunt","Tyrantrum","Zygarde form:fifty_percent","Zygarde form:ten_percent","Wishiwashi form:solo","Wishiwashi form:school","Salandit","Salazzle","Turtonator","Drampa","Jangmo-o","Hakamo-o","Kommo-o","Naganadel","Inteleon","Chewtle","Drednaw","Silicobra","Sandaconda","Arrokuda","Barraskewda","Regidrago"],"eggMoves":["RoaringMoon"],"trMoves":[],"hmMoves":[],"transferMoves":["RoaringMoon"],"tmMoves9":["Ekans","Arbok","Horsea","Seadra","Gyarados","Dratini","Dragonair","Dragonite","Dragonite form:creator","Mew","Feraligatr","Dunsparce","Gligar","Qwilfish","Qwilfish form:hisuian","Kingdra","Lugia","Sceptile","Flygon","Feebas","Milotic","Luvdisc","Latias","Latios","Rayquaza","Gible","Gabite","Garchomp","Gliscor","Dialga","Palkia","Serperior","Krokorok","Krookodile","Alomomola","Axew","Fraxure","Haxorus","Hydreigon","Reshiram","Zekrom","Kyurem","Kyurem form:black","Kyurem form:white","Skrelp","Dragalge","Saland